Author: tabnul <tabnuland@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 25 14:22:49 2026 +0100

    sotc: performance tools (spike sampler, GPU time, route replay)
    
    Everything is off unless switched on:
    - SOTC_SPIKE_OUT=<file> (probe.c) samples every named thread's stack every
      SOTC_SPIKE_US (default 2000) us for the whole run. tools/spike_report.py
      shows what each thread did during the slow frames (SOTCCLOCK in the log
      gives the shared clock).
    - SOTC_GPU_TIME=1 timestamps every submit and logs GPU busy time and the
      idle gaps per second.
    - SOTC_MUTEX_STATS=1 logs contended guest mutex waits by waiter and owner
      site.
    - Pad replay: routes replay by guest frames (bbgpu_guest_frames), and a
      second F9 writes <file>.2 instead of truncating the recording.
      tools/sotc_route.py records and replays a route with a save.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

